---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Downloads the `DevTools` interface for exactly this leptoskit version, checked against the hash built into it. `leptoskit dev` does this on first use; run it ahead of time for CI or to work offline

Usage: leptoskit devtools fetch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --force    Download it again even when it is already there
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
